    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "The move gathers zombie energy to turn a person into a flying zombie and raise body strength more than ten times, but that dense zombie energy makes the backlash severe. The longer the transformation holds, the more zombie energy enters the body; when it devours lifeforce, the user turns into a zombie completely and cannot change back.",
