          574
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "role-in-the-killer-move",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Mo Yao’s will says placing three life force boosting Gu worms in the killer move is her limit. More of them would disrupt the zombie energy and weaken or collapse the move. Fewer would shrink usable time until the transformation is impractical.",
